{"reference":"Jeremiah 2","book":"Jeremiah","chapter":2,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Within the Book of Jeremiah","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Jeremiah 2 stands within a received book that includes poetry, prose sermons, narratives, letters, headings, repeated accounts, restoration collections, oracles concerning nations, and an appendix. A practical outline places chapters 2–25 together, while recognizing that the book’s long compositional and textual history remains debated.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_002_54cbf46b7214ebb1e341064f"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}